msgid "Aparecerá una frase: tócala nota a nota, de izquierda a derecha. Si fallas una nota, sigue buscándola hasta dar con ella."
msgstr "A phrase will appear: play it note by note, from left to right. If you miss a note, keep looking for it until you find it."

#: escalas/templates/escalas/modules/note_reading.html
msgid "Aparecerá una nota en el pentagrama: tócala en el piano. Si te equivocas, la app te dice cuál era."
msgstr "A note will appear on the staff: play it on the piano. If you get it wrong, the app tells you which one it was."

